SUMMARY:Happy Holidays 2026 - Special Offer! 
DESCRIPTION:Toronto History Walks\n**It's that time again! The bells are r
 inging counting down to another year. As promised\, my end of year flash s
 ale\, and this time it's even better!**\n\n**If you're up for renewal in 2
 027\, or you want to try out a new membership the price is $125.00\, for t
 he next 14 months of unlimited tours\, and you get a SECOND PERSON FREE fo
 r the year. If you want to take advantage of this offer your renewal upcom
 ing will be extended to take in the 14 months as well!**\n\n**All PASS hol
 ders have access to the Lectures on the Go series which have been expanded
  for year round learning . So if you want to bump up your membership well 
 into mid-2028\, here's your chance and share the love of learning with som
 eone - our great country and amazing city will thank you.**\n\n**If you de
 cide to take out the membership as a gift for someone\, the same applies\,
  it's a membership for TWO walkers for 14 months.**\n\n**And see you all s
 oon. It's looking to be a great winter ahead.**\n\n**All transactions and 
 e-transfers payments:**\n\n**torontohistorywalks@gmail.com**\n\n**Harley**
 \n**Toronto History walks**
